    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find A Way Out</strong></h2><br>A renowned archer Nuoli, embarks on a journey to escape from a mysterious castle. <br><br>Mizeria is a short game where you need to climb a giant tower with the help of your bow and a friendly spirit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><br>-Simple game where you just have to climb out of a tower.<br><br>-Fun little bow, that can aid your climbing journey.<br><br>- Retro late 90's graphics. All the graphics from the early 5th gen era, with modern controls for smooth yet atmospheric gameplay.",
